## 📈 2.2 Calculate Total Missing Values Percentage

### Dataset Overview

| Metric                 |   Value |
| :--------------------- | ------: |
| Total Rows             |  19,850 |
| Total Columns          |      36 |
| Total Data Cells       | 714,600 |
| Missing Values         |  30,479 |
| Missing Percentage     |   4.69% |
| Non-Missing Values     | 684,121 |
| Non-Missing Percentage |  95.31% |

### 📊 Data Completeness

```text
Missing Data     ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  4.69%
Available Data   ███████████████████░ 95.31%
```

**Insight:** Approximately **95.31% of all data cells contain values**, while 4.69% are missing.

> Note: These percentages represent all cells in the dataset, not the percentage of rows containing at least one missing value.

